### Default URL
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Default API URL
GET http://localhost:5000/api/

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts

### Add a new contact
# @name createContact
POST http://localhost:5000/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "james",
    "age": 20
}

### 2. Récupérer automatiquement l'ID du contact qui vient d'être créé
@contactId = {{createContact.response.body.data._id}}

### Get contact by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/{{contactId}}

### Update contact by ID
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/{{contactId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "james updated",
    "age": 31
}

### Delete contact by ID
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/contacts/{{contactId}}